<section data-aud-show="b2c both" class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section_header is-tight"><h2 class="heading-h2">How it works</h2><p class="text-lead">Three steps from today&#x27;s tool mix to one platform we run for you.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><div class="feature-tile"><img src="/images/home/how-step-1-erp-optional.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/how-step-1-erp-optional-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/how-step-1-erp-optional-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/how-step-1-erp-optional-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/how-step-1-erp-optional.jpg 1280w" alt="" class="image-card"/><h3 class="heading-h3">1. Connect your ERP - or don&#x27;t.</h3><p class="card_text">Your ERP stays the source of truth. Prices, stock and orders sync - without expensive one-off projects. No ERP? That&#x27;s fine. Run without one, or use ours. It&#x27;s included, and optional.</p></div><div class="feature-tile"><img src="/images/home/how-step-2-pos-shop-channels.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/how-step-2-pos-shop-channels-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/how-step-2-pos-shop-channels-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/how-step-2-pos-shop-channels-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/how-step-2-pos-shop-channels.jpg 1280w" alt="" class="image-card"/><h3 class="heading-h3">2. Launch POS, shop, channels</h3><p class="card_text">POS with fiscalization, webshop, portal, OrderHub, Sales App and marketplace channels. Start small; grow when ready.</p></div><div class="feature-tile"><img src="/images/home/how-step-3-sell-run.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/how-step-3-sell-run-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/how-step-3-sell-run-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/how-step-3-sell-run-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/how-step-3-sell-run.jpg 1280w" alt="" class="image-card"/><h3 class="heading-h3">3. Sell - we run the platform</h3><p class="card_text">Buyers and store teams work 24/7. Updates, hosting and security run in the EU. Start free trial - book a demo when you want a walkthrough.</p></div></div><div class="section_header is-tight inline-div-0"><h2 class="heading-h2">Ready when you are.</h2><div class="button-group"><a data-aud-pass="1" href="#trial-url-folgt" class="button is-large w-inline-block">Start free trial</a><a href="#home-booking" class="button is-white is-large w-inline-block">Book a free check on your setup</a></div></div></div></section>